$$<br><br>
$\mathrm{t}_{2 \mathrm{~g}}$ contain 6 electron so it become 3 pairs

For option (A)<br/><br/>
$$
\begin{aligned}
& \mathrm{Cr}^{+3}: 3 \mathrm{~d}^3 \\\\
