& \mathrm{NH}_3: \mathrm{SFL}
\end{aligned}
$$<br/><br/>
No. of unpaired electrons $=0$<br/><br/>
For option (D)<br/><br/>
$$
\begin{aligned}
& \mathrm{Ni}^{+2}: 3 \mathrm{~d}^8 \\\\
& \mathrm{NH}_3: \mathrm{SFL}
\end{aligned}
$$<br/><br/>
No. of unpaired electrons $=2$

