 } } \right.$$,<br/><br/> where a, b are non-negative real numbers. If (gof) (x) is continuous for all x $$\in$$ R, then a + b is equal to ____________.

explanation:
$$g[f(x)] = \left[ {\matrix{
   {f(x) + 1} &amp; {f(x) &lt; 0}  \cr 
   {{{(f(x) - 1)}^2} + b} &amp; {f(x) \ge 0}  \cr 

