   0  \cr 

 } } \right]$$<br><br>$$ \therefore $$ ay + bz = 0 ..... (1)<br><br>$$-$$ax + cz = 0 .... (2)<br><br>$$-$$bx $$-$$cy = 0 ..... (3)<br><br>From equation 1, 2, 3<br><br>$$\Delta$$ = 0 &amp; $$\Delta$$<sub>1</sub> = $$\Delta$$<sub>2</sub> = $$\Delta$$<sub>3</sub> = 0<br><br>$$ \therefore $$ equation have infinite number of solution

